The '''Megafauna Chasm''' was a location within the [[Typhonic Nebula]]. While [[Hyperspace skipping|skipping]] the ''[[Millennium Falcon]]'' away from [[First Order]] pursuers at the [[Sinta Glacier]], [[Poe Dameron]] passed through the Megafauna Chasm and was confronted by an [[Arakurth]].<ref name="TROS">{{Film|IX}}</ref>

